{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026kV6P3Bn0F11793635913.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外長王毅同沙特阿拉伯國家安全顧問艾班會談時稱，沙特始終是中國重要的全面戰略夥伴。</p><p></p><p>對於中東海灣局勢，王毅說，當前地區局勢再次走到戰與和的關鍵路口，希望各方通過對話談判，化解紛爭、平息戰事，維護地區的能源和航道安全。</p><p></p><p>中方認為地區各國應該增進了解、重建互信，改善關係、和睦相處，通過協商推動構建符合地區國家人民長遠利益的地區安全新架構。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T17:20:48.092903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:58:41.137692+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T17:18:27.045553+00:00","content_hash":"01dfc5abcd3bc1a2f7a4e84c3ef8298f7d4bf143f691a43f386a82dd497fb1e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T17:20:48.092903+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}